OL,3,GNEWSAFamily 'will never get over'
OL,4,Amurder of mother
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe niece of a mother-of-four stabbed
OL,7,Fto death by her estranged husband, said
OL,8,Fher family will "never get over" her
OL,9,Fmurder.
OL,11,FOutside Norwich Crown Court on Friday,
OL,12,FAbigail Larkowsky, described the
OL,13,Fdevastation felt by Tania Williams'
OL,14,Ffamily, following the sentencing of her
OL,15,Fkiller after a 17-day trial.
OL,17,FRaymond Williams, 61, was given a life
OL,18,Fsentence and must serve a minimum of 27
OL,19,Fyears for killing the 49-year-old, in
OL,20,Fwhat a judge described as a "brutal
OL,21,Fattack" near her home in Thorpe St
OL,22,FAndrew, Norfolk, in January.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
